Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=24}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.51,0:02:14.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aw, no snow. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.68,0:02:16.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Snow, in this climate?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.11,0:02:18.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure, why not?\NAlready happened once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:20.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You just missed it\Ncause you were asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.99,0:02:23.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! What about you?\NDo you think it's gonna snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.76,0:02:24.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't rule anything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:26.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1020)}But the sea you were\Nin the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.67,0:02:28.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,it snowed was special.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.52,0:02:31.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The seven magnetic fields that\Nemit from Reverse Mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.10,0:02:33.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,tend to make things\Nparticularly chaotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.02,0:02:38.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NBut that doesn't mean\Nyou should relax your guard
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.98,0:02:40.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,while sailing these waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.71,0:02:44.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The odds of it being as wild as\Nyour first journey may be small.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.81,0:02:46.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Still, these waters\Naren't normal
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.67,0:02:49.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and are certain to hold\Nsurprises of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.32,0:02:52.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Remember: Never\Nunderestimate this sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.72,0:02:55.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.56,0:02:57.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyone care to sample\Nmy special drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.79,0:02:59.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAROO squawks]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.39,0:03:01.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.90,0:03:03.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.93,0:03:11.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey, you guys want to\Nget out the fishing gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.77,0:03:13.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NFishing! Hell yeah. I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.80,0:03:14.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NSounds good to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:17.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll even make you one of\Nmy custom fishing rods!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:18.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.61,0:03:19.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, LUFFY gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.49,0:03:22.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWow, somebody's\Nsure thirsty. Have another.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:28.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThe sounds he makes\Nwhen he slurps are hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.01,0:03:29.18,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NYeah, give him another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.27,0:03:32.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're acting like idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.11,0:03:33.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NMaybe this will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.54,0:03:35.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NUh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.01,0:03:36.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:38.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These boys may go through\Ntheir goofy phases,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.48,0:03:40.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but when things get rough,\Nthey get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.68,0:03:42.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Trust me. I should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:44.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I don't know\Nwhat's wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:47.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm getting worked\Nup over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:52.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This ship will put you at ease.\NYou'll cheer up in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.22,0:03:55.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NAttaboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.42,0:03:58.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.09,0:04:00.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAROO squawks]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:04.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY, SANJI, ZORO laugh]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.72,0:04:10.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.26,0:04:13.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. They're... funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:21.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey look, it's a dolphin!\NPirate's best friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.24,0:04:22.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:36.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[STRAW HATS]\N– It's huge!\N– It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.12,0:04:40.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:51.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:51.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAROO squawks]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:52.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NMove it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.64,0:04:53.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NOkay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:54.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NGoing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:59.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.09,0:05:01.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,644)}[USOPP]\NGot it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:02.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take that side!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:03.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NGotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.73,0:05:05.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.10,0:05:08.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, hurry! Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.27,0:05:22.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get ready.\NIt's gonna be a big one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.52,0:05:37.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! Which direction now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.15,0:05:39.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NGimme a second. I'll check.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.63,0:05:48.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Port side... full!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.13,0:05:52.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[STRAW HATS]\N– Turning full!\N– Turning full!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.69,0:06:07.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:13.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.73,0:06:15.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cactus Island and this one here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:19.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are definitely pulling\Nagainst each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.41,0:06:21.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our next stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:23.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.41,0:06:27.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.42,0:06:36.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThis is it! Our second\Nisland in the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.31,0:06:57.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS GOLDEN WEEK]\NMr. 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.15,0:06:59.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NYes, my dear. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.85,0:07:01.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:04.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's nothing quite like\Nthe rich aroma of Earl Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.45,0:07:06.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.81,0:07:08.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NOn the one hand,\Nyou say you're bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:11.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,On the other, you don't\Nlike working. Correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.50,0:07:12.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS GOLDEN WEEK]\NMm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.60,0:07:13.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NThen why don't you\Ncease your complaining
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.60,0:07:15.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and revel in the enjoyment\Nof this rare slice
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.77,0:07:18.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of freedom circumstances have\Ngenerously afforded you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:21.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How grand to be able\Nto take a long vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.93,0:07:24.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A privilege few officers\Never get to indulge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.97,0:07:26.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One more thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.67,0:07:29.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I would appreciate your mindful\Nand immediate discretion
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.34,0:07:32.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}in not calling me by\Nmy code name in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:36.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, people will discover\Nthat I am indeed Mr. 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:39.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.78,0:07:41.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.91,0:07:43.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Incidentally, I couldn't\Nhelp noticing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:45.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you've been perusing\Nthat piece of paper
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:48.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,over the last several days.\NWhy does it grab you so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.39,0:07:49.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's an order from Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.99,0:07:52.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NWhy didn't you\Ntell me sooner?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.76,0:07:59.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It says Mr. 5 has\Nbeen taken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.47,0:08:01.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If someone had to\Nbe terminated,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.11,0:08:03.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wish it would've been\Nsomeone useless like Mr. 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.95,0:08:05.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So it would benefit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.44,0:08:07.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With a fat promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:08.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not that, necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.45,0:08:12.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rather, the downfall of Mr. 5\Nis hardly exciting news at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.18,0:08:14.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The man excelled at nothing\Nbut his own idiocy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:18.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,clinging to his devil fruit\NPower like a drowning rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.66,0:08:21.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are correct that a modicum\Nof my indifference stems from
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:23.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the fact that 5's misfortune\Nbrings me no gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.99,0:08:24.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All we may learn is
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.99,0:08:28.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,power means nothing if\Nnot properly harnessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.90,0:08:34.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NSuperior\Ncriminals are those
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.52,0:08:37.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who execute their crimes\Nusing superior intellect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.39,0:08:41.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, whoever beat Mr.\N5 should be made an example of,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:43.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if for no other reason than\Nto preserve the reputation
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.19,0:08:46.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(4337,0,1,\c&HF8F9F6&\3c&HF8F9F6&\4c&HF8F9F6&)}of terror our organization has\Npainstakingly cultivated,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:49.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and indeed for criminality\Nas a whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.59,0:09:02.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can see why they call\Nthis place Little Garden!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.69,0:09:04.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't.\NWhat's "little" about it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.83,0:09:07.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this island looks\Npretty harsh if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:08.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why the cute name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.47,0:09:11.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NY-Y-Yeah, it looks\Nlike a jungle out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:13.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe we'd be better\Noff skipping this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.58,0:09:14.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.81,0:09:19.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't help but remember the\Nwarning Miss All Sunday gave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:22.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what, we might be attacked\Nby giant monsters?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.74,0:09:23.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHeh! Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:25.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NListen, I'm sure we can\Nmake it to the next island
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.81,0:09:27.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,without going ashore\Non this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.61,0:09:30.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only way to reset\Nthe log is to go ashore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.18,0:09:31.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not to mention we're\Nin dire need
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:33.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of re-stocking our food supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:36.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We didn't get so much as a sack\Nof flour in the last town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.62,0:09:39.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guys! There's our ticket in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.79,0:09:40.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.61,0:09:47.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThink they'll have a\Nbarbecue restaurant here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.63,0:09:49.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWe didn't travel\Nall this way for barbecue!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.57,0:09:51.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI thought the point\Nof this visit was to get food?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:54.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NFood as in supplies\Nwe're going to cook later!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.07,0:09:55.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what're you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.78,0:09:56.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.62,0:10:00.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp might be right\Nabout this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:03.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just take a look at the\Ngargantuan plant life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.22,0:10:05.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything\Nlike it, not even in books.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.85,0:10:08.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BIRD screeches]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.89,0:10:11.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI, USOPP scream]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.22,0:10:13.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're so adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:15.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.85,0:10:18.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not funny!\NI was talking to Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.39,0:10:20.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What was that screeching?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.25,0:10:21.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.92,0:10:24.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's all right, love.\NIt's only a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.26,0:10:26.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Perfectly harmless.\NJust like this jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:27.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nothin' to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:29.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI, USOPP scream]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.05,0:10:31.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NUh... What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.37,0:10:40.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWhat the hell's the\Nmatter with you, ya damn bird?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:42.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ooh. It's big. Could be tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.81,0:10:45.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:49.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hear that?! Is that\Nthe kinda noise
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:52.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you expect to hear\Nin a normal jungle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.12,0:10:54.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(2576,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}That sounded like\Na volcano erupting!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:56.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're all going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.90,0:11:08.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A tiger?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.61,0:11:11.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's gigantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.21,0:11:15.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:17.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.97,0:11:22.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! Luffy, what\Njust happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:26.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know normal!\NThis is definitely not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:28.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Someone explain to me\Nhow a mammoth tiger
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.80,0:11:31.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,can just keel over\Ncovered in blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:34.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Log-Pose and food be damned!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.57,0:11:37.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're not stepping foot on\Nthat island and that's final!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:39.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can still reset the\Nreadings on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.57,0:11:41.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll just sit tight until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.27,0:11:43.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When that's done, we'll\Nleave and never look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.74,0:11:44.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NGreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.61,0:11:48.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Great. We'll\Nall just stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.23,0:11:57.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.36,0:11:59.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji, go make lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.57,0:12:00.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You want lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:02.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYep, and one more thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.64,0:12:04.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Make it a great big\N"pirate lunch"...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.16,0:12:06.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with lots of meat\Nand no veggies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.58,0:12:08.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need\Nsome more energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.81,0:12:10.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh! Energy for what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.31,0:12:12.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!\NYou're not leaving here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.65,0:12:14.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know! Heh, heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:16.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fun stuff! Do ya\Nwanna come along?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.32,0:12:17.65,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.65,0:12:19.53,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NIt's useless. I can't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:20.93,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He's too enthusiastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.93,0:12:22.12,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NIs he crazy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.12,0:12:24.05,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Somewhere out there is\Na monster big enough
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.05,0:12:26.60,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,to grind a tiger into paste!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.60,0:12:28.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji! I'm starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.31,0:12:29.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right. Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.76,0:12:31.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll have it to you\Nas soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.59,0:12:34.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.61,0:12:35.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.61,0:12:37.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Would it be all right if\NI come along with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.27,0:12:38.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP yelps]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:39.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure! Sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.27,0:12:41.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NNo! Vivi, you can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.87,0:12:43.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'd rather not sit here
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.73,0:12:46.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with nothing to do but\Nworry about my troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.11,0:12:48.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This will keep me busy\Nuntil the log's reset.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.38,0:12:50.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Out of the question! Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.15,0:12:52.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's way too dangerous\Nfor you out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.28,0:12:55.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. Besides,\NI'll have Karoo with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.89,0:12:57.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[squawks]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:13:00.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey something's wrong.\NKaroo doesn't look too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.66,0:13:01.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He might be in shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.66,0:13:03.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi, if you go exploring,\Nyou'll need to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.83,0:13:04.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll pack you a lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.90,0:13:06.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:08.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,While you're at it, could you\Nfix something for Karoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:11.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course! You just\Nleave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.53,0:13:17.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:25.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now you're all set\Nand ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.71,0:13:27.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Two pirate lunches\Nfor Luffy and Vivi,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:29.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and a special drink for Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.43,0:13:31.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh! Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.34,0:13:38.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NWell. See you guys later!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.81,0:13:42.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!\NEverything will be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:46.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi. What a girl.\NShe's so brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:47.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And just what would\Nyou expect from someone
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.91,0:13:50.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who could infiltrate\Nthe enemy's ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:55.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO sighs]\NI'm bored.\NI'm gonna take a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.11,0:13:56.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take a walk?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.22,0:14:02.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh! Hey! Zoro! Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.66,0:14:03.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.63,0:14:05.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know we're kinda\Nshort on food, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.60,0:14:08.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you find any animals that\Nappear edible, bring'em back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.50,0:14:10.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:12.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I could see why you'd want\Nto send me, cause I can
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.30,0:14:14.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,bring back somethin' you\Ncouldn't catch yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.51,0:14:16.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWhat the hell\Ndoes that mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.48,0:14:17.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.74,0:14:20.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NI won't let that\Nremark go unchallenged!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.45,0:14:22.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're saying you can capture\Nbigger game than I can?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.98,0:14:26.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like my hunting skills\Nare inferior?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.18,0:14:28.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:35.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Challenge accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:41.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay! Winner brings back\Nthe most pounds of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.63,0:14:44.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whaddaya mean pounds,\N'cause I'll bring back tons?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:46.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWhy don't you let your\Nhunting do your talking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.32,0:14:48.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHeh. Good luck, cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.06,0:14:51.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will never understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.56,0:14:54.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why do those two jerks have\Nto be so competitive?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:56.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't cry. If it makes\Nyou feel better,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.13,0:14:58.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm just as stumped by\Ntheir behavior as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.97,0:15:03.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[animals chattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.07,0:15:04.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, NAMI gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.37,0:15:05.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're sitting ducks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:08.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you think I\Nalready know that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.38,0:15:09.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, NAMI exhale]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.13,0:15:14.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I think\Nof that before?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.90,0:15:17.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh?! Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.30,0:15:20.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NNami, what's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.34,0:15:23.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NMm. That's not it...\NMm... Not this one either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.06,0:15:24.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Nope.\N– [USOPP grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.29,0:15:25.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! Whoa! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.94,0:15:28.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you\Nlooking for anyway?! Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.28,0:15:29.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NQuiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.18,0:15:31.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I remember reading\Nabout it in a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.45,0:15:33.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NUh. Reading about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:34.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLittle Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.52,0:15:38.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.68,0:15:39.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NHey, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.78,0:15:41.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Over here! Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.45,0:15:44.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a shellfish that\Nlooks like a squid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.52,0:15:49.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NShell squidfish! Heh, heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.09,0:15:49.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.89,0:15:52.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It sort of resembles\Nan ammonoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:54.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.34,0:15:59.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAROO squawks]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.26,0:16:09.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've got a feeling someone's\Nbeen following me for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:11.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nah, couldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.84,0:16:16.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[T-REX roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.75,0:16:27.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.22,0:16:28.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I'm busy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.85,0:16:30.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[T-REX roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.19,0:16:33.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[SANJI]\NCollier Coup!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.96,0:16:43.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHm... I don't know\Nwhat you're supposed to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.96,0:16:45.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I'm guessing you're edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.65,0:16:51.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLet me see... which one was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.55,0:16:52.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.65,0:16:54.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think I read it recently,\Nbut I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.99,0:16:57.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The title's on the\Ntip of my tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.89,0:16:59.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:05.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHuh. That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.22,0:17:07.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's a sea king doing on land?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.96,0:17:13.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.60,0:17:14.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.90,0:17:17.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI gasping]\NNo way! This is unreal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.54,0:17:18.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NUh, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.47,0:17:20.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Somehow this island\Nhas been frozen in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.88,0:17:23.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stuck in the age\Nof the dinosaurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.71,0:17:24.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:26.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NTravel in the\NGrand Line is so difficult,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.72,0:17:28.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so no species ever migrated\Nbetween the islands
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.92,0:17:31.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and their unique ecosystems\Nwere preserved!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.82,0:17:33.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Some of these islands\Nhave developed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.53,0:17:35.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,extremely sophisticated\Ncultures,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.62,0:17:38.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,both biological\Nand sociological.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.02,0:17:40.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,While others remain in a sort\Nof evolutionary stagnation,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.82,0:17:43.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with little to no progression\Nfor several thousands
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.21,0:17:44.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or tens of thousands,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.30,0:17:50.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or, in this case, it seems,\Neven millions of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:52.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can only assume that\Nit's the random climates
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.67,0:17:55.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,within the Grand Line\Nthat make this possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.14,0:17:57.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean... What other\Nexplanation is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.74,0:18:00.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're standing on the island\Nthat pre-dates mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.48,0:18:03.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.01,0:18:04.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.66,0:18:09.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.33,0:18:12.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Usopp?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.19,0:18:15.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHuh? Nami. What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.78,0:18:17.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So did you find your book yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.47,0:18:20.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.34,0:18:26.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[T-REX roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:31.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThis is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.01,0:18:32.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This... island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.58,0:18:34.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What. What's wrong Nami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.63,0:18:45.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.76,0:18:48.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.53,0:18:57.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why do I get the sense\Nthat Nami needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.73,0:19:00.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.37,0:19:02.54,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,[LOUIS ARNOTE]\NTo those who reside here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.54,0:19:05.38,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,and call this island home,\Nit must seem as if they've
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.38,0:19:08.38,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,stumbled upon their\Nvery own private garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.38,0:19:10.38,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,Thus, I have aptly\Nnamed this wondrous,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.38,0:19:13.62,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,terrifying place. Little Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.72,0:19:18.10,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,Louis Arnote, Explorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:32.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[both whimpering]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:34.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:37.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Well, what is the answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.37,0:19:39.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Could you repeat that?\NI didn't catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.61,0:19:41.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please... sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.28,0:19:45.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I asked if you had any alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.15,0:19:47.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I drank mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:48.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.92,0:19:51.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, you do?! That's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:52.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NUm, there's just one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.65,0:19:53.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,it's not the drinking kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.71,0:19:55.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's for cooking\Nand disinfecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.85,0:19:57.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, if that's acceptable...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.58,0:19:59.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...you're... welcome to it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.39,0:20:00.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.35,0:20:01.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Nami, Usopp shriek]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.69,0:20:05.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[T. rex growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.02,0:20:07.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Usopp yelping]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.66,0:20:08.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.73,0:20:11.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[T. rex growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:14.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[T. rex growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.33,0:20:16.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whimpering]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.27,0:20:17.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Brogy yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.67,0:20:18.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Nami screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.90,0:20:20.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Usopp screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.27,0:20:23.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[both shrieking]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.78,0:20:25.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm Brogy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.26,0:20:29.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the Elbaph's strongest\Nwarrior! Invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.18,0:20:31.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[bellows]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.76,0:20:34.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Nami, Usopp gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.76,0:20:36.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now I have dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.49,0:20:38.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And the two of you\Nare invited as my guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.66,0:20:42.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Nami, Usopp whimper]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.03,0:20:43.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BROGY]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:46.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BROGY]\NYou okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:48.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whispering]\NJust\Npretend you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.06,0:20:50.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\Ndon't move a muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:52.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Nami whispering]\NBut playing\Ndead only fools bears!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.57,0:20:54.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It won't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.67,0:20:59.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BROGY]\NHuh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.70,0:21:06.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhoa! What an amazing view!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.31,0:21:11.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is a perfect\Nspot for our lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.71,0:21:13.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We aren't here to\Nhave a picnic, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.61,0:21:15.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need to keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.48,0:21:17.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.51,0:21:19.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They have active volcanoes here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.99,0:21:21.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not only that! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.46,0:21:23.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a mountain with\Nhuge holes in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:24.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Luffy chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:26.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NIt's dangerous up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.39,0:21:28.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come down already!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.14,0:21:29.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.27,0:21:30.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelps]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.74,0:21:34.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Luffy yells, laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.74,0:21:39.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, no! This is awful!\NHe's been eaten alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.32,0:21:43.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa. It got dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.72,0:21:46.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Luffy yelps]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.49,0:21:47.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NCool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.99,0:21:53.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.92,0:22:01.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.46,0:22:05.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Luffy yelps]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.82,0:22:07.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Luffy grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.62,0:22:13.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.69,0:22:18.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.42,0:22:23.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.96,0:22:26.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[giant laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.79,0:22:28.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What fun! That was glorious!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.22,0:22:31.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Watching the likes of you\Ngrapple with longnecks
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.49,0:22:33.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}is the most entertainment\NI've had in quite a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:35.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are my first\Nvisitor in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.29,0:22:38.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow, you are huge!\NAre you human?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.78,0:22:42.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.35,0:22:44.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Greatest warrior of all Elbaph!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.29,0:22:45.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am Dorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.46,0:22:47.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.72,0:22:50.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a... giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.83,0:22:53.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've heard that they exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.61,0:22:56.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I've never actually\Nseen one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.40,0:22:57.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, hi! I'm Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.80,0:22:58.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'm a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.84,0:23:00.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:02.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A pirate?! Well, good\Nfor you, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.93,0:23:04.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.43,0:23:05.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NKaroo! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.40,0:23:07.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to get out\Nof here while we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.90,0:23:11.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,By the way, I'd like you to meet\NVivi and Karoo. Say hi to Dorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.90,0:23:15.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's great, Luffy!\NJust can't shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.74,0:23:17.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.44,0:23:18.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell ya what.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.41,0:23:21.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You're all invited to my home!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.41,0:23:27.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[Dorry laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.06,0:23:41.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [Brogy laughing]\N– [Nami, Usopp gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.49,0:23:44.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go on, eat hearty my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.53,0:23:46.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It tastes delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.70,0:23:51.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I... I think I've\Nlost my appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.37,0:23:53.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy now! Dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.55,0:23:57.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[BOTH]\N– No, I don't wanna eat!\N– No, I don't wanna eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.85,0:23:59.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BROGY]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.35,0:24:00.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dinosaur meat is sweet...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.75,0:24:03.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I promise you, it's quite tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.72,0:24:05.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess he's\Nattempting to fatten us up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.71,0:24:07.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,before he kills us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.49,0:24:08.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll be plump and juicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.95,0:24:10.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I never thought\Nit'd end like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.99,0:24:13.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a typical barbaric giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.50,0:24:16.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWe're too young\Nto die... Too young.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.38,0:24:18.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NMaybe that's the appeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.28,0:24:20.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BROGY]\NWhat a waste. It's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.48,0:24:24.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't know what a\Nscrumptious meal you're missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.48,0:24:26.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't eat until\Nthe Log resets...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.45,0:24:28.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we can keep our hunger\Nand waistlines in check,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.62,0:24:29.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we might survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.79,0:24:30.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.86,0:24:32.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know how much longer\NI can hold out, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.90,0:24:34.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I don't eat something\Npretty soon, I'm not sure
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.96,0:24:37.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll have the strength or\Nwill power to resist his offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.89,0:24:40.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Usopp sobs]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.59,0:24:45.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NBrogy, sir? Do you\Nmind if I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.36,0:24:47.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's on your mind, young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.30,0:24:49.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NUm, how long will it take
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.41,0:24:51.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to reset the log on this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.64,0:24:52.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One full year.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.84,0:24:56.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[both gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.18,0:24:59.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A year... If we waited\Nthat long to eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.27,0:25:01.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't have\Nstomachs to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.35,0:25:02.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.21,0:25:03.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to admit defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.88,0:25:06.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're\Ngonna fall asleep again!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.42,0:25:08.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.89,0:25:13.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Dorry laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.43,0:25:17.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Luffy laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.93,0:25:21.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[LUFFY]\NYou sure know\Nhow to cook, giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.63,0:25:23.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Why, thanks for the compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.30,0:25:24.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your pirate goodies\Nare excellent, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.70,0:25:25.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,my little friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.64,0:25:27.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Although the portions\Nare a little small!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.43,0:25:27.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.53,0:25:29.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know what ya mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.59,0:25:32.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But the chef on my ship\Nmade it especially
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.73,0:25:34.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for this trip, so I'm\Nglad you liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.76,0:25:36.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Cause otherwise,\NI'd have to beat you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.53,0:25:39.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[stutters]\NWas that\Na threat... Shorty?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.50,0:25:40.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Vivi gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.97,0:25:43.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]\NI like you,\Nlittle pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.06,0:25:45.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're really funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.39,0:25:47.36,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NThey're becoming fast friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.36,0:25:49.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh. I don't mean to pry,\Nbut why do you choose
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.51,0:25:51.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to live out here\Nall by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.40,0:25:53.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you have a\Nvillage to call home?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.80,0:25:55.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I came from a village...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.59,0:25:57.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a place of many\Nwarriors called Elbaph.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.67,0:26:00.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It once was home, but I\Nno longer call it that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.37,0:26:01.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.17,0:26:02.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are certain\Nrules in Elbaph,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.51,0:26:04.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,which must be obeyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.05,0:26:04.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What kind of rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.59,0:26:07.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DORRY]\NFor example,\Nif a fight breaks out
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.82,0:26:10.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and neither side yields,\Njudgment is handed down
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.56,0:26:14.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,by Elbaph's god. Whoever he\Ndeems to be righteous
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.47,0:26:16.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,will be declared the winner\Nand granted survival
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.82,0:26:18.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,as well as divine protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.82,0:26:21.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSo Elbaph's god decides?\NThat doesn't seem fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.85,0:26:23.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DORRY]\NFair or not, all that matters
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.67,0:26:25.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is this is our battleground.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.79,0:26:28.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As on Elbaph, our god will\Ndecide who is righteous
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.49,0:26:31.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and worthy of winning both\Nthe duel and his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.66,0:26:32.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.97,0:26:34.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've fought for a century, but,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.83,0:26:37.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Elbaph has yet to\Nchoose a champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.93,0:26:37.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.95,0:26:40.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys have been fighting\Nfor more than 100 years?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.79,0:26:42.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,From a human's point of view,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.72,0:26:44.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,100 years may seem\Nlike a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.16,0:26:46.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but it isn't considering\Na giant's average lifespan
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.13,0:26:47.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is three times yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.50,0:26:49.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.17,0:26:50.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even with all the\Ntime in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.81,0:26:51.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd think your desire would wane
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.80,0:26:54.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,after 100 years\Nof the same battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.20,0:26:56.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At this point, is there\Nany real animosity left
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.34,0:26:59.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,between you? Or are you\Njust fighting to fight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.41,0:27:10.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NWow, that's\Nsome explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.72,0:27:13.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well then... It's\Ntime to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.74,0:27:14.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.67,0:27:15.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.70,0:27:20.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[rumbling, explosions]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.66,0:27:22.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.91,0:27:24.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,An eruption...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.79,0:27:28.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.20,0:27:35.52,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NI don't like that\Nlook. He seems angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.52,0:27:36.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.02,0:27:39.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but there is something\NI must attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.99,0:27:42.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? You're leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.51,0:27:43.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.58,0:27:45.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the signal my\Nopponent and I use to mark
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.61,0:27:48.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the beginning of our fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.01,0:27:49.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NA fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.21,0:27:50.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWith whom? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.71,0:27:52.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And more importantly, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.58,0:27:53.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BROGY]\NWhy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.88,0:27:55.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.28,0:27:58.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.03,0:28:01.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And before we realized,\Nit became our routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.21,0:28:03.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That volcano is our marker.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.91,0:28:06.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whenever it erupts, we begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.03,0:28:09.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's senseless! How\Ncould you have so much
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.17,0:28:12.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,hatred for someone that you'd\Nfight them for a century?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.51,0:28:15.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What could have happened\Nto make you this mad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.18,0:28:17.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi, that's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.41,0:28:20.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not what\Nthis is about, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.51,0:28:28.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right.\NThis is about honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.45,0:28:34.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.24,0:28:39.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have forgotten...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.52,0:28:44.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DORRY]\N...the reason for our brawl!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=25}===============================DIALOGUE============================
